,53,77,29],[24375,23.6,1976,52,77,24],[24673,19.0,2020,57,80,27],[24674,37.5,1976,57,82,25]],"links":[["Utah County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/utah/utah-county"],["ARC or PLC in Utah County","/arc-plc/utah/utah-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 17 grids in Utah County shows May to June came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years since 1951, more than any other pair. In 2025 June to July on the middle of the grids ran 19% of normal, and May to June ran 49%. So far in 2026 the middle of the grids shows Feb-Mar at 59% and May-Jun at 59%. Grid 23772 had its driest year in 2020 at 39%.</p>"}
